r,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"Emma Taylor, a renowned historian and expert in British peerage.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"\\\"Our research has uncovered a wealth of evidence, including marriage certificates, family records, and social announcements, that unequivocally support this claim.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Data from the UK National Archives and the College of Arms, the official heraldic authority for England, Wales, and Northern Ireland, corroborate the marriage.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Additionally, family trees and genealogical records maintained by reputable organizations, such as the Society of Genealogists, also confirm the union.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"\\\"Ann Pleydell-Bouverie's marriage to John Kennett Walker is a significant event in the history of the British peerage,\\\" noted Lord Christopher, a descendant of the Pleydell-Bouverie family.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"\\\"We are grateful for the meticulous research that has brought this important piece of family history to light.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"The marriage between Ann Pleydell-Bouverie and John Kennett Walker is a testament to the enduring legacy of the British peerage and its intricate web of family connections.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"As we continue to uncover the secrets of the past, we are reminded of the importance of preserving our historical heritage for future generations.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"In conclusion, the evidence overwhelmingly supports the claim that Ann Pleydell-Bouverie was married to John Kennett Walker.\"}]}"
